      "kind": "h3",
      "text": "Online Giving"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Simple and secure. Use this page or text FCCINTL to 1-888-364-4483 to set up your giving account. Give a single gift, or schedule recurring giving using your checking account, debit, or credit card."
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Our platform uses industry-leading security to protect your personal information and is never charged to your phone bill."
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "text": "Give In Person"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "You can also give in person during the weekend and mid-week worship experiences"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "text": "Mail A Check"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Please make checks payable to Faith Christian Center International and mail to the to the following address:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Faith Christian Center International"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Attn: Finance"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2186 Richmond Road"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "Charlottesville, Virginia 22911"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "THANK YOU FOR YOUR FINANCIAL SUPPORT"
    },
    {
      "kind": "h2",
      "text": "Thank you so much for your support of our ministry. We receive each offering as a major blessing towards our God given assignment. We have been called by"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "God to do great things in and around our community and none of it would be possible without your financial support. Every penny of your tithes and offerings will"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "be put to great use for God's work in our lives. We believe for you to experience God's best in your financial affairs because of your generous giving. Together, we make it happen!"
    }
  ],
